{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5664190343419931643,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "![MC1-DOOM Logo](logo/mc1-doom-logo.png)",
      "source_hash": 14625992343692574494,
      "context_hash": 751762985712676198,
      "translation": "![MC1-DOOM 로고](logo/mc1-doom-logo.png)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "MC1-DOOM",
      "source_hash": 7807832100799646182,
      "context_hash": 8052107863912211516,
      "translation": "MC1-DOOM",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is the classic game DOOM (by id Software) ported to the [MRISC32](https://mrisc32.bitsnbites.eu/)-based computer [MC1](https://github.com/mrisc32/mc1).",
      "source_hash": 3273034916485439385,
      "context_hash": 17534867317009528105,
      "translation": "이것은 id Software의 클래식 게임 DOOM을 [MRISC32](https://mrisc32.bitsnbites.eu/) 기반 컴퓨터 [MC1](https://github.com/mrisc32/mc1)으로 이식한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Origins & License",
      "source_hash": 13461899712975481014,
      "context_hash": 10930773391543101518,
      "translation": "기원 및 라이선스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "MC1-DOOM is based on the original linuxdoom v1.10 code base from 1997, with some bugfixes and alterations to make it work on MRISC32, and of course graphics and I/O routines for the MC1 computer.",
      "source_hash": 12519736957199688226,
      "context_hash": 16627415002238218742,
      "translation": "MC1-DOOM은 1997년의 원본 linuxdoom v1.10 코드베이스를 기반으로 하며, MRISC32에서 동작하도록 일부 버그 수정과 변경이 이루어졌고, 물론 MC1 컴퓨터를 위한 그래픽 및 I/O 루틴도 포함되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Original [README.TXT](iddoc/README.TXT).",
      "source_hash": 7049383443346792530,
      "context_hash": 2643689515406039063,
      "translation": "원본 [README.TXT](iddoc/README.TXT).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The source code is released under the GNU General Public License, as outlined in [DOOMLIC.TXT](iddoc/DOOMLIC.TXT).",
      "source_hash": 1534531350629666543,
      "context_hash": 9077957915612339291,
      "translation": "소스 코드는 [DOOMLIC.TXT](iddoc/DOOMLIC.TXT)에 명시된 대로 GNU General Public License로 배포됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Building for MC1",
      "source_hash": 9155924004785750246,
      "context_hash": 9018419348786723256,
      "translation": "MC1용 빌드하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In order to build MC1-DOOM for an MC1 target, you need the MRISC32 GNU toolchain installed.",
      "source_hash": 9197069985463236309,
      "context_hash": 10684964475684860529,
      "translation": "MC1 타겟용으로 MC1-DOOM을 빌드하려면 MRISC32 GNU 툴체인이 설치되어 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "You can find it [here](https://github.com/mrisc32/mrisc32-gnu-toolchain).",
      "source_hash": 14281935447351212892,
      "context_hash": 9112371561628914254,
      "translation": "[여기](https://github.com/mrisc32/mrisc32-gnu-toolchain)에서 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The resulting binary is `src/out/mc1doom.bin`.",
      "source_hash": 1779590100403963027,
      "context_hash": 11443574126409412242,
      "translation": "결과 바이너리는 `src/out/mc1doom.bin`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Building for other platforms",
      "source_hash": 2647544892630795356,
      "context_hash": 8314962058677583348,
      "translation": "다른 플랫폼용 빌드하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For testing purposes, you can also build MC1-DOOM for other platforms, such as Linux.",
      "source_hash": 16344914294722825390,
      "context_hash": 6385530563491197951,
      "translation": "테스트 목적으로 Linux와 같은 다른 플랫폼용으로도 MC1-DOOM을 빌드할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "To install dependencies on Ubuntu:",
      "source_hash": 15866524440882103228,
      "context_hash": 12688259416608496355,
      "translation": "Ubuntu에서 의존성 설치하기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "To build:",
      "source_hash": 6246005546471507212,
      "context_hash": 11289297417269635872,
      "translation": "빌드하기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Game data",
      "source_hash": 16593839974675303502,
      "context_hash": 5212239560667327718,
      "translation": "게임 데이터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To run Doom you need a game WAD file.",
      "source_hash": 16979785705292030247,
      "context_hash": 13160810676467491475,
      "translation": "Doom을 실행하려면 게임 WAD 파일이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For instance the [shareware version of Doom 1](https://doomwiki.org/wiki/DOOM1.WAD).",
      "source_hash": 17411324962050027395,
      "context_hash": 14697077380436516587,
      "translation": "예를 들어 [Doom 1의 셰어웨어 버전](https://doomwiki.org/wiki/DOOM1.WAD)이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`mc1doom` will search for a valid WAD file in the current working directory (i.e. the folder from which the program is started).",
      "source_hash": 17226317323921468863,
      "context_hash": 11618777756975430707,
      "translation": "`mc1doom`은 현재 작업 디렉터리(즉, 프로그램이 시작된 폴더)에서 유효한 WAD 파일을 검색합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:58.641070Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}